# Catering POS needs NO secrets or API keys to run.
# All data is stored on the device (IndexedDB) and PDFs are generated on the device.
#
# WhatsApp: the app uses Android's share sheet (and wa.me chat links), which needs no credentials.
# Fully automatic sending through the WhatsApp Business Cloud API is NOT configured.
# If you add it later, the access token must live on a server you control — never in this app:
# WA_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
# WA_ACCESS_TOKEN=          # server-side only
# WA_TEMPLATE_NAME=          # approved document template
